      },
      "message": "chore(process): sync process files to upstream PROCESS_VERSION 10\n\nPulls AGENTS.md, .claude/agents, .claude/skills, .claude/PROCESS_VERSION,\nxtask/, .cargo/config.toml and the gate/release/decision wrappers from\nupstream/main. The fork's cut tag (v0.16.0) predates xtask (#748), so\n\"xtask\" joins the workspace members and Cargo.lock takes the package.\nNo product code changes; the fork's code stays on v0.16.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
