      "message": "chore(fork): sync to upstream v0.17.0\n\nFork sync at the cut tag (AGENTS.md: a fork takes upstream's code only\nat a cut tag). The fork's own commit (the PROCESS_VERSION 10 process\nsync) was already in v0.17.0's tree; Cargo.lock conflicted only on the\nxtask package both sides added and takes the tag's. The resulting tree\nis identical to v0.17.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
